Description:It is your upkeep. You control Kami of the Crescent Moon, a Swamp and a Plains, and Ornithopter is in your graveyard. Your library, top first: Redress Fate, Dark Ritual, then Colossal Dreadmaws. End the turn with Ornithopter on the battlefield. The opponent must stay at 20 life.
Rule:rulesguru-2875a02ad500af1f | Revealing a miracle card only triggers its ability (CR 702.94a); the miracle trigger and Kami of the Crescent Moon's draw trigger are put on the stack together and you choose their order (CR 603.3b): let the Kami draw Dark Ritual first, cast it, then pay the miracle cost {3}{W} with its mana and the Plains
